# Build output
/target/
**/target/

# Rust
**/*.rs.bk

# Node / Tauri UI (apps/desktop) — created when the desktop task begins
node_modules/
dist/
apps/desktop/src-tauri/target/
apps/desktop/gen/

# Local environment and secrets. Never commit these (AGENTS.md section 3.5).
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
!docs/**/*.md

# OS and editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

# Test and coverage output
*.profraw
coverage.xml
lcov.info

# Python bytecode. Added 2026-10-18 after scripts/__pycache__/*.pyc was found TRACKED:
# importing the audit and clean-VM scripts from a test put compiled bytecode in the index,
# and .gitignore does not apply to files that are already tracked.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Experiment scratch area (M1 prototype code must not enter the production tree —
# tasks.md rule 4). Nothing from here is committed.
scratch/